  "id": 203987692264339,
  "uuid": "d82a8f68-3069-4d14-9795-ba8dfa22d958",
  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "ffec9152-8098-b0f1-8106-1152ab1b0f7a",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "8211f3c1-c6b4-a02a-473d-31059a0dd58b",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Barbara's transition from nutrition to communication was unexpected but natural. Her initial experiences in event planning and project management sparked a passion for the strategic aspects of communication. This realization, coupled with a defining moment during her Chevening Scholarship application, solidified her decision to specialize in strategic communications.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Currently, Barbara works as the Regional Communications Advisor at the Swiss Foundation for Technical Cooperation (Swisscontact), where she focuses on expanding financial access for marginalized populations, particularly in regions like Kakuma. She is passionate about empowering individuals with practical skills to enhance their livelihoods.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "One of the biggest challenges Barbara faced was shifting the perception of communication within organizations. She explains, \"In the beginning, communication was seen as a tactical function. But I knew it needed to be a strategic function.\" By consistently demonstrating the value of strategic communication, Barbara has successfully challenged traditional perceptions.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Mentorship has played a pivotal role in Barbara's career evolution. Collaborating with seasoned career and life coaches has been transformative. Their guidance and support have helped Barbara gain clarity on her strengths and how to apply them in the communications field.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Barbara's determination and self-belief have also been key to her success. Winning the 2022 Public Relations Society of Kenya - PRSK \"Internal Communications Campaign of the Year\" award was a significant milestone that solidified her position as a skilled communications professional.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "As Barbara continues her journey, she is focused on honing her leadership skills and embracing new challenges. She believes that leading change is never easy but is essential for growth. For aspiring professionals, Barbara's advice is simple yet powerful: \"Keep pushing forward, no matter the setbacks. Every challenge is an opportunity to grow.\" ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
